{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "82734f64-f29e-8c1d-bdc3-0530e8c598f0",
  "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:47:39-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Maria Pacheco",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:45:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:45:04-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good morning. Um, I am calling about the trash pickup? I want to ask about the schedule."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:45:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing, happy to help. Which schedule, the regular one or the holiday week?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:45:16-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The new one, after the holiday week. Is it changing? I heard maybe it moves by one day, but I am not sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:45:24-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that's usually how it goes. When a holiday lands in the week, pickup slides back a day. What's your address, and I'll tell you your day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:45:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. It is 338 Dean Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:45:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "338 Dean Avenue, got it, writing that down. Fifth Ward, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:45:40-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:45:42-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so let me pull that up. [pause] Alright, your regular day is Thursday. Following the holiday week, you'd go to Friday for that one week, then back to Thursday after."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:45:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Friday, one week only? Then Thursday again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:45:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. Friday for the one week, then back to normal."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:46:00-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you. That is very clear. Um, I have one more question. My recycling bin has a big crack on the side. How do I ask for a replacement?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:46:10-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, yeah, that happens. You can request a new one through us here. I can put the request in right now. Is it the blue recycling bin or the trash barrel?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:46:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The recycling. The blue one. It cracked when it was cold, I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:46:26-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Makes sense, plastic gets brittle. Okay, replacement recycling bin, 338 Dean Avenue. I'll note it's cracked down the side. Is the lid okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:46:34-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The lid is okay. Only the side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:46:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Do you want us to leave the old one out, or will somebody pick it up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:46:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm, I am not sure? Should I leave it by the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:46:48-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, set the cracked one at the curb on your pickup day, and they'll swap it. Might take a week or two to get the new one out to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:46:58-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is okay, no problem. I am not in a hurry. I am saving for a small condo of my own, so I try to keep my house things working and not buy new."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:47:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, good for you, that's a great goal. Hopefully this one costs you nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:47:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is good! Thank you so much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:47:19-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you want me to have someone call you if there's any hiccup? I've got a number here, ending in zero one nine one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:47:28-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is correct. Zero one nine one. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:47:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're all set, Maria. Have a good Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T11:47:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Thank you, bye-bye."
    }
  ],
